2. HOW MUCH OF WINNING IS WINNING POINTS, AND HOW MUCH IS CONVERTING THEM?
==========================================================================================
   fitted on winner-minus-loser diffs, mirrored so the base rate is exactly 50%:
   serve/return POINT stats only                  AUC  98.0%   (n=108349 matches)
   CLUTCH/conversion stats only                   AUC  98.8%   (n=56154 matches)
   both together                                  AUC  99.5%   (n=56145 matches)

   points alone get you to 98.0%; adding the clutch layer takes it to 99.5%  (+1.4pt)
   clutch ALONE is already 98.8% -- converting matters nearly as much as winning points

